{"id":"3eb92e9813a09fca9f8ca52cb7781ff4cc30b6dc","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1240108","title":"公司现在不让安装代理类的软件，想要继续使用 GPT，如何破局","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Veliqo","excerpt":"问与答 - @Veliqo - 如题，国企类的公司应该会遇到类似问题，网络受限、非合规软件不让装，远程工具也不让装。怎么办？我开了 GPT 5x ，不让我用我就废了","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/Veliqo\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4c6a/98fc/476881_xlarge.png?m=1788491855\" width=\"73\" alt=\"Veliqo\" data-uid=\"476881\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/Veliqo\">Veliqo</a> · <span title=\"2026-09-07 16:22:18 +08:00\">21h 39m ago</span> · 1592 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div>\n        \n        <p>如题，国企类的公司应该会遇到类似问题，网络受限、非合规软件不让装，远程工具也不让装。<br>怎么办？我开了 GPT 5x ，不让我用我就废了</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div>\n        <p><span>Supplement 1 &#160;·&#160; <span title=\"2026-09-07 17:47:24 +08:00\">20h 14m ago</span></span></p>\n        \n        <p>完了，看了评论区吓得我退缩了，无解了</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    \n</div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/网络\"><li></li> 网络</a><a href=\"/tag/限制\"><li></li> 限制</a><a href=\"/tag/GPT\"><li></li> GPT</a></P><p><span>22 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-07 20:13:40 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058401\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6a1/2393/233073_normal.png?m=1572831959\" alt=\"heyjei\" data-uid=\"233073\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/heyjei\">heyjei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:26:11 +08:00\">21h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>软件工程中有一个过程叫 bootstrap：你可以先接入国内的大模型，让他开发一个中转工具，通过 VPS 去连接 GPT ，然后再用这个中转工具去连接 GPT 就可以了。</p><p>好处是 IP 地址还不会变，。。。。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058403\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dfa/8c1c/38436_normal.png?m=1560377701\" alt=\"msg7086\" data-uid=\"38436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:26:30 +08:00\">21h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>兄弟喜欢开出租或者送外卖吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058426\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cb69cab5e84b67f4d68d7a5cf6745fe9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"berchtesgaden\" data-uid=\"560514\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/berchtesgaden\">berchtesgaden</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:29:00 +08:00\">21h 32m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你没有自己的笔记本电脑吗？在国企就别想那些乱七八糟的手段了，别碰红线。要上网要用大模型，就在自己的笔记本用，最后哪怕多复制几次</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058533\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/60df/cc1d/686441_normal.png?m=1785768580\" alt=\"Vesc\" data-uid=\"686441\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Vesc\">Vesc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:45:01 +08:00\">21h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>自己弄个服务器中转吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058544\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/20b7/5f31/741706_normal.png?m=1784762342\" alt=\"Moishine\" data-uid=\"741706\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Moishine\">Moishine</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:46:46 +08:00\">21h 14m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>还是要严守安全红线，别给自己找事。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058545\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e8c4/cb10/380494_normal.png?m=1781252209\" alt=\"AlohaV2\" data-uid=\"380494\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AlohaV2\">AlohaV2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:46:59 +08:00\">21h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>矿泉水瓶装茅台呀，搞个自用中转</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058572\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f399/d5ea/223096_normal.png?m=1600056410\" alt=\"syubo2810\" data-uid=\"223096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/syubo2810\">syubo2810</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:50:47 +08:00\">21h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>切国内模型吧，也差不了多少，国企来说肯定够用了，别自己没事找事，国企不犯错比什么都重要</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058593\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/266c45ffd42b4b256a34461299dc017e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Plutooo\" data-uid=\"631520\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Plutooo\">Plutooo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:53:57 +08:00\">21h 7m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>分清楚是不让安装代理还是不让数据外露，只是不让安装代理的话搞个服务器中转一下就能解决，不让数据外露还是别用了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058621\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3975/6000/662828_normal.png?m=1778314902\" alt=\"ktyang\" data-uid=\"662828\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ktyang\">ktyang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:56:54 +08:00\">21h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>公司不管个人电脑使用就用个人电脑，用 u 盘光盘拷贝都行，千万不要搞什么自己打洞这种操作，其他人出问题的时候你跳进黄河也洗不清。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058643\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7f21/bc1b/365603_normal.png?m=1731906122\" alt=\"Wenlon\" data-uid=\"365603\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Wenlon\">Wenlon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 16:59:10 +08:00\">21h 2m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>用国产吧，没有明着规定都好说，既然明确规定了，就不要搞花活了。技术手段不应该用来绕过合规红线，不然真出问题了，哪怕不是你直接导致的，你也容易吃瓜落</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058709\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b3d0/4cbe/427384_normal.png?m=1755166367\" alt=\"94\" data-uid=\"427384\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/94\">94</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 17:07:51 +08:00\">20h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>不让用就没必要顶着被辞退的风险去用。现在本来就是敏感时期，如果有可以无成本辞退员工的机会，你看领导会不会利用起来。</p><p>国产模型大部分的 CRUD 工作都可以应付的了。如果是项目设计，可以在自己的电脑上面设计好 Plan 、TaskList ，然后通过手机 IM 发送到公司设备上，让国产模型去干执行。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058869\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9e419bf4efb1250d0552534f9d209e5a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ttsh\" data-uid=\"751027\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ttsh\">ttsh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 17:33:09 +08:00\">20h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 ds 啊，只是普通 coding 来说没太大问题吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058903\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7d4d/0353/609132_normal.png?m=1739682565\" alt=\"ugpu\" data-uid=\"609132\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ugpu\">ugpu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 17:37:58 +08:00\">20h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ds 就行了<br>  你非要用 做好辞退的准备 然后买个国内阿里云转发到自己的 vps 中转就行。 编辑器的插件做到每日重新安装和下班自动卸载. <br>  别直接连自己的 vps 域名 运维那就等着你这种人才写报告呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058914\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/788a/7841/488388_normal.png?m=1589242690\" alt=\"qiuhang\" data-uid=\"488388\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qiuhang\">qiuhang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 17:40:03 +08:00\">20h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不让用你就别用呗，用国产 llm 干活又不是干不了，至于慢点或者没那么好那关你什么事？客观条件所限。<br>至于自己开 pro 账号然后踩着红线干公司的活，没有比这更离谱的了，古代死士或者家奴都没这么夸张的，至少前者不用自带干粮。<br>如果你自己装代理什么的越了红线，要搞你的话，轻则裁员是时候不用赔偿完全合法。重则给你个律师函投个大帽子，也不是无法可依。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18058925\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ace44da8013e8ba249418747de60ca5f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Gemini4422335\" data-uid=\"529983\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Gemini4422335\">Gemini4422335</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 17:42:47 +08:00\">20h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国内厂商的境外服务器+cpa 代理+国内域名转发，你在 config 中访问国内域名+/v1 就行了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18059224\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/45a469441c4db8d0304870ad3a9bd90e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lmsh7\" data-uid=\"526858\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lmsh7\">lmsh7</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 19:39:51 +08:00\">18h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>评论区好多老登啊, 一辈子混吃等死吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18059226\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80ac/32fc/580231_normal.png?m=1755248272\" alt=\"ndxxx\" data-uid=\"580231\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ndxxx\">ndxxx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-07 19:41:46 +08:00\">18h 19m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>kimi3 其实还可以，除了贵，而且前提是你抢得到 plan</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18059293\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1556/043b/585665_normal.png?m=1778037095\" alt=\"Gnnbb\" data-uid=\"585665\"></td>\n                